  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1253742/description_761a4b84-9432-4f3d-befb-0f28f4d4d515.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"212\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">整合幸運方塊是一款對經典幸運方塊類型的全新演繹！擁有超過 100 種原版結果，搭配所有相容模組後更超過 300 種，等待開啟的驚喜不勝枚舉。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">掉落內容包含物品、建築結構、生物以及眾多其他事件。它們可能會造成相當大的破壞，因此請謹慎選擇開啟的位置！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">模組相容性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Alex's Caves</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Alex's Mobs</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Create</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">The Outer End</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Jellyfishing</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">'Dustrial Decor</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Caverns and Chasms</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Blighted Beasts</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Vouniern's Turrets</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Artifacts</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Dimensional Doors</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Rotten Creatures</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Compound V</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Jolly Boxes</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Born in Chaos</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Species</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Opposing Force</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Invincible: Conquest</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">若有更多模組相容性的請求，歡迎在留言區或我的 Discord 中提出！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XQ3Bs7F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/A_Bit_of_Everything/BH_BOE_Discord.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">有興趣架設伺服器嗎？&nbsp; 點擊上方圖片，結帳時輸入代碼 BLUE，即可在 BisectHosting 首月享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>",
